"""Short bilingual paragraphs; keep behavior, examples and limitations explicit."""
from pathlib import Path
import json

root=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
base=root/'src/main/resources/assets/sablelife'
updates={
'schema_note':(
    'Read current values and ranges in the module editor. Hover controls for help; some appear only in the selected mode. Sound layers use the sound timeline.\n\nThese chapters describe ordinary Heart Core modules. Other core types and server switches may restrict them.',
    '当前数值和范围请查看模块编辑器，悬停控件可看说明；部分属性只在对应模式出现。声音分层在声音时间轴编辑。\n\n模块章节以普通生命核心为准，其他核心与服务器开关可能限制功能。'),
'defaults':('In the editor','编辑器提示'),
'core.usage':(
    'Core settings affect the whole creature: health, regeneration, protection, targeting and death effects. Use the Survival Heart Core chapter for that core\'s fixed rules and Energy costs.\n\nHealth regenerates after the configured quiet period following damage. It cannot revive a dying or dead creature. Configure drops through Whole-body loot on the module dashboard.',
    '核心设置控制整个生命体的血量、回血、保护、选取目标和死亡特效。生存生命核心的固定规则与能量费用见其独立章节。\n\n受到伤害后，需等待设定时间才开始回血；回血不能复活正在死亡或已死亡的生命体。战利品在模块主页面的掉落战利品中配置。'),
'core.settings':(
    'Health and rewards\nHealing per second = fixed regeneration + maximum health x regeneration percent / 100. Both use the same post-damage delay. XP Points gives a fixed amount; XP Levels adds levels to the collector, like /experience add levels. Converting units uses cumulative XP from level zero.\n\nInteraction\nSurvival interaction defaults Off. Off locks supported devices and their open inventories for Survival/Adventure players while active; Creative is unaffected. On permits interaction, while mining and placement retain separate rules. Core status remains accessible. Dormant/released builds and Redstone Cores use normal rules; third-party remote controls may need adapters.\n\nAdaptive defense\nDefaults: Off, 100 HP/s threshold, 80% maximum, 1-second window. Damage is measured after part armor, before adaptive reduction. Sustained 200 DPS approaches 50% reduction; 1,000 DPS reaches the 80% cap. These are not a hard DPS cap or invulnerability window.\n\nOther defense\nKnockback resistance defaults 0%; 100% blocks supported Melee/Shockwave/Earthquake impulses, not their damage. Attraction, self-movement, gravity and native collisions are unaffected. Full heal on player kill defaults Off; it requires an attributed Survival/Adventure player death. Totems and later environmental or damage-over-time kills do not count.\n\nTerrain breaking\nCollision terrain breaking defaults Off. When enabled: contact delay 0, support protection On, visual debris On, block drops Off. It breaks at actual block shapes, not empty gaps in the bounding box, before Travel step assist. Other Sable structures are not removed. Containers may release contents even with block drops Off. Server budgets apply.\n\nProtected blocks\nUp to 128 block IDs or #tags. Load preset merges 20 common natural blocks without duplicates. Inventory samples consume no items; Shift-click adds, right-click removes, Confirm commits and Cancel discards. Non-block items are ignored. Grid entries show full IDs on hover; tags use books and itemless blocks use barriers.\n\nTargets\nTarget Whitelist & Factions excludes listed usernames from automatic targeting, including All; names ignore case and may be offline. Rename entries when players rename. It does not protect against stray projectiles.\n\nEach creature has one faction; players may join several. Public factions are open; private factions need a creator/operator invitation and acceptance in Details. Invites use UUIDs and online/previously seen names. Select a faction to assign this creature; None clears its assignment. Leaving as a player does not remove existing creatures. Only creators/operators manage privacy, members, deletion and alliances.\n\nAlliances are direct and require both factions to agree; A-B and B-C do not ally A-C. Either side may end its alliance. Same-faction/allied creatures skip automatic targeting. Friendly Fire covers incidental Sable Life damage within a faction; allied damage requires both sides to allow it. Other mods\' weapons are outside these switches. Factions grant no editor, mining or interaction access; unknown copied UUIDs create no alliance.\n\nPriority and Owner\nPriority ranks eligible targets when selecting/reselecting: Nearest, Players First, Sable-Life Creature First or Other mob first. Existing locks and multi-target rules remain. Owner is optional and case-insensitive; Owner mode selects only that player, even if whitelisted, and waits if unavailable. Other automatic attacks and direct module damage exclude the owner. Owner grants no editing access and can appear in death messages.\n\nWorld and death\nVoid death height checks the active core\'s world-space center: strictly below it kills regardless of defense. Default: dimension minimum Y (-64 Overworld; 0 Nether/End). Dormant builds and Redstone Cores are unaffected. Right-click Apply restores the default.\n\nForce chunk loading defaults Off; On follows active/dying connected parts. Release, core removal, cleanup completion or switching Off releases tickets. Limits: 256 target chunks per creature, 1,024 server-wide.\n\nDeath delay is 0-60 seconds. Death effects play at zero health; vanish effects after the delay. Each has its own sound mix; Restore resets only that stage. Core names support standard & formatting and &#RRGGBB within 64 characters. Direct module kills use the launch-time styled name; later environmental/status deaths use vanilla attribution.',
    '生命与奖励\n每秒回血＝固定回血＋生命上限×回血百分比／100；两种回血都受受击后等待时间影响。经验“点数”给固定经验，“等级”像 /experience add levels 一样给拾取者增加等级；单位换算以从零级累计的经验为准。\n\n生存交互\n默认关闭：激活时禁止生存／冒险玩家操作支持的装置，并关闭其已打开的物品栏；创造玩家不受影响。开启后允许交互，挖掘与放置仍遵循各自规则。核心状态仍可查看。休眠／已解除的结构和红石核心保持普通交互；其他模组的远程控制可能需要适配。\n\n动态免伤\n默认关闭，阈值 100 HP/s、最高免伤 80%、窗口 1 秒。统计部位免伤后的伤害，再计算动态减伤。持续 200 DPS 时约减伤 50%，1,000 DPS 时达到 80% 上限；阈值不是硬性 DPS 上限，窗口也不是无敌时间。\n\n其他防御\n击退抗性默认 0%；100% 可挡住支持的近战、冲击波和地震波推力，不减少其伤害。牵引、自身移动、重力和原生碰撞不受影响。击杀玩家回满血默认关闭，需归因于生命体的生存／冒险玩家死亡；图腾、后续环境或持续状态伤害致死不计入。\n\n碰撞破坏地形\n默认关闭。开启后的默认值：接触延迟 0、支撑保护开、飞散碎屑开、方块掉落关。只按实际方块形状破坏，不清空边界内的空隙，并先于直线移动的跨步辅助处理；不会移除其他 Sable 结构。碎屑只是视觉粒子。容器可能自行掉出内容物，即使方块掉落关闭。受服务器预算限制。\n\n保护方块列表\n最多 128 个方块 ID 或 #标签。“载入预设”合并 20 种常见自然方块并去重。物品栏取样不消耗物品：Shift 点击添加、右键移除、确认提交、取消放弃；忽略非方块物品。悬停图标可看完整 ID，标签用书本、无物品形态的方块用屏障表示。\n\n目标白名单\n添加后立即排除自动选取，包括 All；名字不分大小写，支持离线名字。玩家改名后需更新。白名单不提供流弹免伤。\n\n阵营\n每个生命体加入一个阵营，玩家可加入多个。公开阵营可直接加入；私人阵营需创建者／管理员邀请，并在详情中接受。邀请使用 UUID，名字需在线或曾在服务器出现。点击阵营分配当前生命体，None 清除其归属；玩家退阵营不会移除已有生命体。只有创建者／管理员能管理公开状态、成员、删除和结盟。\n\n结盟与友伤\n结盟需双方同意，且只对直接结盟生效：A-B、B-C 不代表 A-C 结盟，任一方可解除。友军和盟军不自动互相选为目标。友伤开关只控制阵营内本模组伤害；盟军伤害需双方都允许。其他模组武器不在此范围。阵营不授予编辑、挖掘或交互权限；从其他世界复制未知 UUID 不会建立联盟。\n\n优先级与 Owner\n优先级在筛选后选取／重选目标：最近、玩家优先、Sable-Life 生命体优先或其他生物优先；不改变已有锁定和多目标规则。Owner 可留空，名字不分大小写。Owner 目标模式只选该玩家，即使其在白名单中；不可用时等待，不换人。其他自动攻击和直接模块伤害排除 Owner。Owner 不授予编辑权限，可出现在击杀播报中。\n\n世界与死亡\n虚空死亡高度检查激活核心的世界中心，严格低于该高度即死亡，不受防御影响。默认采用维度最低 Y：主世界 -64，下界／末地 0；休眠结构和红石核心不受影响。右键确认按钮恢复默认。\n\n强制区块加载默认关闭；开启后跟随激活／死亡中的相连部件。关闭、解除、移除核心或清理完成会撤出票据。上限为每只 256 个目标区块、全服 1,024 个。\n\n死亡延迟为 0-60 秒。血量归零播放死亡特效，延迟后播放消失特效；两阶段声音独立，“恢复”只重置对应阶段。名字支持标准 & 格式与 &#RRGGBB，合计最多 64 字符。模块直接击杀采用发射时保存的格式化名字；后续环境／状态致死采用原版归因。'),
'core.death_envelope':(
    'Death effect shape\nThe immediate effect surrounds the connected structure, including limbs. Radius 0 fits it automatically, up to 256 blocks; a positive radius fixes the size. Spread varies positions. Burst/cloud start around the sphere; ring/star/spiral keep their shapes; Flash stays central. Sound range is separate.\n\nVanish effects appear at blocks being removed after Death delay, including batched cleanup. Reward positions do not move.',
    '死亡特效范围\n瞬间特效包围相连结构及肢体。半径 0 自动适配，最大 256 格；正数固定范围，扩散调整位置变化。爆发／云团围绕球面，环／星／螺旋保留形状，闪光仍在中心；声音范围独立。\n\n死亡延迟后的消失特效出现在正被清理的方块上，包括分批清理；不改变奖励位置。'),
'core.boss_colors':(
    'Boss bar color\nUse the selector beside Boss bar. Left/right click cycles forward/backward; Red is the default. Color is saved and may change while alive without resetting health.',
    '首领血条颜色\n使用首领血条旁的颜色按钮，左／右键正向／反向切换，默认红色。颜色会保存，可在激活时修改，不重置血量。'),
'core.whole_cleanup':(
    'Cleanup\nAfter Death delay, a fully loaded creature can be removed in one tick if every non-air block belongs to its cleanup group. Unloaded parts wait; mixed ownership or failed checks use batched cleanup. Supported mounted cannons/bearing contraptions and attached decorations are cleaned with their registered controllers, without affecting unrelated controllers.\n\nAt most one whole-creature deletion is attempted per tick, with up to 1,048,576 registered coordinates. Larger groups use batches. A large atomic deletion can still pause the server; the per-block budget does not split it.',
    '死亡清理\n死亡延迟后，若全部部件已加载且所有非空气方块都归属本次清理，可一 tick 整体移除。未加载部件等待；混合归属或检查不通过时改为分批清理。支持的炮架、轴承动态结构和附着装饰会随其登记控制器清除，不影响无关控制器。\n\n每 tick 最多尝试移除一个完整生命体，最多 1,048,576 个登记坐标；更大的组分批处理。大型整体移除仍可能短暂停顿，不会被逐方块预算拆分。'),
'arena.settings':(
    'Arena rules\nMark a fixed world center and set the horizontal radius. The leaving countdown starts when the creature leaves, not when players leave. Nearby-player death defaults On; Force return with full health defaults Off and takes precedence. No-nearby-player return is separate.\n\nWith Iris active, respawn text and progress use a world-positioned HUD overlay after shader rendering, retaining distance scaling. This does not change normal text displays.',
    '场地规则\n标记固定世界中心，设置水平半径。生命体离开才开始越界倒计时，不是玩家离开。附近有玩家时死亡默认开；满血强制归位默认关，开启后优先。附近无人时归位是独立选项。\n\n开启 Iris 光影时，重生文字与进度在光影后按世界位置绘制到 HUD，并保留距离缩放；不改变普通文字实体。'),
'arena.range_buffs':(
    'Range buffs\nDefaults Off. Up to 16 groups, each with 16 persistent effects at levels 1-5; no instant healing/damage. Effects last 2 seconds and refresh once per second.\n\nOnly living Survival players in the same dimension and within horizontal Player range around the core receive them, even while the creature is inside its arena. The module must be enabled, marked and triggered.\n\nFollow module needs no extra input. Internal/External channel reads a core output/receiver; 0 is unbound. External frequencies are set in Wireless. Highest level wins when groups overlap.\n\nFor a phase change, send Health phase outputs to separate channels and bind the groups. Signal loss, leaving range, disabling or death stops refresh; effects expire naturally, may briefly overlap and do not clear unrelated effects. Config copies retain bindings; presets need new channel bindings.',
    '范围 Buff\n默认关闭。最多 16 组，每组 16 种持续效果，等级 1-5；不含瞬间治疗／伤害。每秒刷新，持续 2 秒。\n\n只作用于同维度、核心水平“玩家范围”内存活的生存玩家，生命体在场地内也可生效。模块需启用、标记有效且触发。\n\n跟随模块无需额外输入；内部／外部频道读取核心输出／接收信号，0 为未绑定，外部频率在无线频道配置。多组重叠时同种效果取最高等级。\n\n阶段切换可用血量阶段输出不同频道，再分别绑定效果组。失去信号、离开范围、禁用或死亡后停止刷新；已有效果自然到期，可能短暂重叠，不清除无关效果。配置复制保留绑定，预设需重绑频道。'),
'arena.respawn':(
    'Record and enable\nAutomatic respawn defaults Off and needs compatible Sable Photomancy (tested 1.0.1). An interface failure disables respawn and identifies the missing member in the server log; other features remain usable.\n\nAs a Creative operator, mark Arena center, record the connected structure, enable respawn and set cooldown (default 60 seconds, minimum 5). Re-recording replaces that creature\'s record. The template retains relative poses, settings, modules, internal references and inventories; its basis anchor, not necessarily its bottom, goes to Arena center.\n\nRespawn cycle\nCooldown starts at death. Placement waits for the old body/limbs to finish cleanup and for destination chunks to load; it does not force them. Native placement is synchronous and activates a fresh full-health creature with new IDs, rebound marks and reset runtime state. All rebuilt parts are registered even if joints are not ready. Incomplete restored parts pause their block-entity ticks until data/joints are applied, including after reload. The record is reused for later generations.\n\nCountdown\nText/progress appears above a standable surface at the anchor X/Z, preferring below then above; without support it uses anchor height. This moves only the display. The countdown survives core deletion and world saves.\n\nStop or recover\nClear record stops future respawns, leaving the current creature. After core removal, an operator within 64 blocks of the anchor/display can use /sablelife_respawn cancel. It removes only that record\'s known partial bodies and orphan displays. Failed builds stop rather than duplicate; old incremental builds retain recovery support.\n\nLimits and cautions\nRecords stay server-side, outside presets, client menu snapshots and ordinary blueprint copies. Limits: 32 records, 32 parts and 256 captured entities. Default configurable limits: 131,072 blocks, 16,384 block entities, 4,194,304 bounding-box cells, 32 MiB per template and 128 MiB per world. Rejections show actual/maximum amounts.\n\nUnallocated plot gaps count as empty, without creating chunks. Nearby rope-adjacent builds need an actual connected-chain link to be captured. Supported joints/addon data are preserved; test other addons. Recorded inventories and rewards repeat intentionally. Large captures or native placement can pause the server.',
    '记录与启用\n自动重生默认关，需要兼容的 Sable Photomancy（已测试 1.0.1）。接口不兼容时禁用重生，并在服务端日志指出缺失接口；其他功能仍可使用。\n\n创造管理员先标记场地中心，记录相连结构，再开启重生并设置冷却（默认 60 秒，最低 5 秒）。重新记录替换该生命体的旧记录。模板保留相对姿态、设置、模块、内部引用与物品栏；场地中心对准模板基准点，不一定是底部。\n\n重生流程\n死亡时开始冷却，等旧本体／断肢清理完成、目的地区块加载后才生成，不强行加载。使用原生同步放置，随后激活满血新生命体：新 ID、重绑标记、重置运行状态。即使关节尚未就绪，所有重建部件也会登记归属。数据／关节未应用完的部件暂停方块实体 tick，重载后也保持此保护；记录可继续用于后续重生。\n\n倒计时\n文字／进度显示在中心 X/Z 的可站立表面上，优先选基准点下方，再找上方；无支撑时回退到基准高度。只移动文字，不移动模板。倒计时独立于旧核心保存，删核心或重启后仍保留。\n\n停止与恢复\n清除记录停止后续重生，不删除当前生命体。旧核心消失后，管理员可在中心／倒计时文字 64 格内使用 /sablelife_respawn cancel，清除该记录已知的未完成部件与孤立文字。生成失败会停止，避免重复；旧版分批生成仍保留恢复支持。\n\n上限与注意\n记录只存在服务端，不进入预设、菜单快照或普通蓝图复制。上限：32 记录、32 部件、256 捕获实体。默认可配置：131,072 方块、16,384 方块实体、4,194,304 边界体素、单模板 32 MiB、全世界 128 MiB；拒绝时显示实际值／上限。\n\n未分配的存储区空隙视为空气，不新建区块；绳索靠近不等于连接，需属于真实相连链。支持的关节与附加数据会保留，其他模组需先测试。记录的物品栏与奖励会反复恢复；大型记录或原生放置仍可能卡顿。'),
'natural_spawning.settings':(
    'Load and enable\nAdd a rule, choose a server blueprint and Load. Activate core: Yes requires one ordinary Heart Core and no Redstone Core; No permits pure structures. Set Conditions, then Enable.\n\nDensity and population\nDensity sets success cooldown, failed-search retry, candidates per search and player distance. All rules share at most one search round per second, stopping after success. There is no separate percentage chance.\n\nMax present limits this rule. Server defaults: 64 tracked objects across all rules/dimensions, 4 within 128 blocks. Unloaded objects count; these caps do not multiply. Current shows the tracked number.\n\nCleanup\nLifetime counts server game time; 0 disables it. No-player cleanup starts with no living non-Spectator within 128 blocks; returning resets it. Either timer can request removal, even with self chunk loading. Unloaded objects retain deadlines and are removed when required data loads. Pure structures follow the same rules.\n\nRelease after spawning detaches new objects from counts, timers and Clear all current. Lifetime 0 alone does not release them.\n\nTerrain\nGround clearance lifts the blueprint. Require open sky rejects cover. Water below a flying build is allowed if outside its checked volume. Loaded terrain, world bounds and other applicable checks remain.\n\nSkip full blueprint bounds check tests occupied volumes instead of the enclosing box. Clear obstacles can cut terrain/buildings inside the bounds; ownership, block entities, unbreakable blocks and budgets can block it. Workbench protection still applies.\n\nBiomes, faction and announcement\nEmpty biomes means any. Overworld includes non-ocean Overworld biomes, including correctly tagged modded ones; add oceans explicitly. Wilds is the hidden default faction and does not automatically attack itself.\n\nAn announcement broadcasts after every successful spawn, including Test spawn and released objects. Blank disables it. Coords appends the actual blueprint bottom-center coordinates; it defaults Off and clears with blank text.',
    '载入与启用\n添加规则，选择服务器蓝图并载入。“激活核心：Yes”要求一个普通生命核心且没有红石核心；No 可生成纯结构。设置条件后启用。\n\n密度与数量\n密度控制成功后冷却、失败重试、每轮候选点数和玩家距离。所有规则共享每秒最多一轮自动搜索，成功后停止；没有独立百分比概率。\n\n本蓝图在场上限只管本规则；服务器默认全规则／全维度共 64 个，128 格内最多 4 个，卸载对象也计数。这些上限不会相乘；Current 显示追踪数量。\n\n清理\n寿命按服务器游戏时间计算，0 关闭。128 格内没有存活的非旁观玩家时开始无人计时，玩家返回会重置。任一计时到期都可请求清理，自带区块加载也不阻止。卸载对象保留到期状态，所需数据加载后执行；纯结构同样适用。\n\n生成后放生会让新对象脱离计数、计时与“清除当前所有”。只把寿命设为 0 不等于放生。\n\n地形\n离地间距抬高蓝图；需要露天会拒绝有遮盖的位置。飞行结构下方的水若不进入检查体积则允许。仍需满足已加载地形、世界边界等检查。\n\n跳过完整蓝图边界改为检查实际占用体积；清除障碍可削掉边界内地形／建筑，但归属保护、方块实体、不可破坏方块和预算会阻止。工作台保护仍生效。\n\n群系、阵营与公告\n群系为空表示不限。Overworld 包括主世界非海洋群系及正确标记的模组群系；海洋可单独加入。Wilds 为隐藏默认阵营，不自动互相攻击。\n\n每次成功生成后发送公告，包括试生成和放生；留空关闭。Coords 附加实际蓝图底面中心坐标，默认关，清空文字也会取消。'),
'natural_spawning.workbench':(
    'Workbench protection\nFixed-world vanilla crafting tables block spawning within 64 horizontal blocks of the entire blueprint footprint, at every height. Test spawn, bounds-skip and clearing obey it. Tables on moving Sable structures do not carry this zone.\n\nServer config wildWorkbenchProtectionRadius accepts 0-256; 0 disables it. This excludes spawns, not existing creature movement, damage or editor access, and does not cover every modded workbench.\n\nChunks are indexed in budgeted batches; later table changes update the cache. Verified records survive unload/restart. Unknown or evicted records wait for loaded verification, without forcing chunks. A pending message may mean surrounding terrain is unloaded. Removing the last table in a column removes its protection.',
    '工作台保护\n固定世界的原版工作台默认保护整张蓝图占地边缘外 64 格，按水平距离、所有高度生效。试生成、跳过边界与清障都遵守；Sable 结构上的工作台不会带着保护圈移动。\n\n服务器 wildWorkbenchProtectionRadius 可设 0-256，0 关闭。它只排除生成，不阻止已有生命体移动、伤害或编辑，也不涵盖所有模组工作台。\n\n首次分批建索引，之后拆放更新缓存，已验证记录跨卸载／重启保留。未知或被淘汰的记录等待加载验证，不强行加载；数据未就绪可能是周边地形未加载。同列最后一个工作台拆掉后，该列保护解除。'),
'linear_movement.settings':(
    'Direction and target\nFixed distance follows the mark and angle offsets. Toward target chooses by core priority within search range, then records its position at charge start; it does not chase later movement or turn the structure automatically. No target means waiting.\n\nStop before target measures mark-to-target-center distance, not a gap between hitboxes. Use target height Off keeps current height/horizontal distance; On uses the recorded height and 3D distance. Creative-player inclusion is separate. Owner mode selects only the named owner, even if whitelisted, and waits if unavailable; other target modes exclude that owner.\n\nTeleport or Travel\nTeleport moves after charging; Travel moves gradually. Both check loaded destinations and world borders. Force movement (default Off) skips collision prechecks, not those checks; forced Travel maintains its planned route until normal physics resumes at the end. Charge/departure/arrival effects are separate.\n\nGravity Travel\nDefault Off. On drives connected parts horizontally while retaining relative limb motion, vertical velocity and rotation; vertical aim and Force are ignored. Only actual horizontal progress counts. A blocked run times out; ending brakes horizontal motion without suspending the build.\n\nStep assist\nTravel only, gravity On or Off; default Off. Grounded parts can lift the whole build together over 0.3 seconds, braking vertical velocity. Default height 1 block (0.1-2), cooldown 0.6 seconds. Clear the obstruction and regain clear ground contact before another step; limbs cannot stack lifts. There is no headroom guarantee, and sparse/rotated builds may tip. Gravity resumes after a gravity-assisted lift; without gravity, route height stays raised until movement ends. Lift does not count as forward progress. Terrain breaking runs first.\n\nTurning and Preview\nTravel can steer with Auto facing or Signal turning; fixed-direction routes turn with the structure without resetting distance. Target routes keep their recorded destination. Teleport pauses turning through its completion tick. Active Signal turning takes precedence over Auto facing; Hover anchor/Gyroscope retain their priorities. Preview shows the current heading, not future steering or a predicted landing.',
    '方向与目标\n固定距离沿标记方向及角度偏移移动。朝向目标按核心优先级在范围内选取，并在蓄力开始时记录位置；不持续追赶，也不自动转向。无目标时等待。\n\n提前停止距离按标记点到目标中心计算，不是两者碰撞箱的间隙。“采用目标高度”关：保持当前高度、计算水平距离；开：采用记录高度和三维距离。是否包含创造玩家另设。Owner 模式只选指定玩家，即使其在白名单中，不可用就等待；其他模式排除 Owner。\n\n传送或行进\n传送在蓄力后移动，行进逐步移动；都保留目标区块加载与世界边界检查。强制移动默认关，开启只跳过碰撞预检；强制行进维持计划位移，结束后恢复正常物理。蓄力／出发／到达特效独立。\n\n受重力影响\n仅行进，默认关。开启后给相连部件共同的水平驱动，保留肢体相对运动、竖直速度与旋转；忽略竖直瞄准和强制移动。只统计实际水平前进，顶墙不算；受阻最终超时。结束会制动水平移动，不把结构悬在空中。\n\n跨步辅助\n仅行进，重力开／关都可用，默认关。着地部件发现合适障碍时，全体用 0.3 秒同步抬升并制动竖直速度。默认高度 1 格（0.1-2）、冷却 0.6 秒。需越过障碍并重新清楚着地才能再抬，不同肢体不能叠加；不保证头顶空间，稀疏／倾斜结构仍可能翻倒。重力模式抬升后恢复重力；无重力模式把路线高度保持到动作结束，抬升不算前进。先处理碰撞破坏，再判跨步。\n\n转向与预览\n行进可配合自动朝向／信号转向，固定方向路线随结构转动，不重置距离；目标路线仍去已记录位置。传送从蓄力到完成 tick 暂停转向。信号转向优先于自动朝向，悬停锚点／陀螺仪保留各自优先级。预览只显示当前朝向，不预测后续转弯或落点。'),
'getting_started.automation':(
    'Automation: three controls to learn\nMove set selects moves using conditions, priority and weight; its action windows schedule supported attack, movement, sound and function modules.\n\nWireless Channel is the core\'s channel page. Internal numbers belong to this core; external reception uses matching red/blue frequency items. A channel number is not a global wireless frequency.\n\nWireless Redstone turns a trigger into marked-face redstone, external frequency output or an internal signal. It can turn a Move set action window into input for another module.\n\nFirst combination\n1. Enable channel 1 as Sequence / internal; keep wireless Master On.\n\n2. Give Move set the Always trigger and Ignore conditions. Add a Wireless Redstone action from 0 to 2 seconds.\n\n3. Set that module to Move set trigger, Continuous output, Invert Off, internal output channel 1. It needs no marked output face or frequency items.\n\n4. Let an enabled, marked Particle effects module with a selected particle read internal channel 1. It emits in that window; old particles finish their lifetimes afterward.\n\nThen read Move set, Triggers and signals, and Wireless Redstone. Keep input/output channels separate while learning to avoid feedback.',
    '自动化从这里开始\nMove Set（自定义动作抽选）用条件、优先级和权重选招，用动作窗口调度支持的攻击、移动、声音与功能模块。\n\nWireless Channel（无线频道）是核心的频道页面。内部编号属于本核心，外部接收需匹配红蓝频率物品；频道编号不是全局无线频率。\n\nWireless Redstone（无线红石）把触发转成标记面红石、外部频率输出或内部信号，可把一段动作窗口交给其他模块读取。\n\n第一个组合\n1. 启用频道 1，设为“序列控制／内部”，保持无线总开关开启。\n\n2. 抽选控制器选持续激活、忽略条件，加入一个 0-2 秒的无线红石动作。\n\n3. 该无线红石选抽选触发、持续输出、反转关、内部输出频道 1，无需输出面标记或频率物品。\n\n4. 让已启用、已标记且选好粒子的粒子模块读取内部频道 1，即可在窗口内发射；已有粒子按自身寿命结束。\n\n再分别阅读动作抽选、触发与信号、无线红石章节。初学时分开输入／输出频道，避免信号自保持。'),
}
updates.update({
'particles.settings':(
    'Marks and size\nArea uses two corners; Point/Line/Ring/Sphere share a separate single mark. Start distance offsets the origin. Area/Point extensions add forward Length and symmetric Width/Height (0-128); the volume rotates with its part. Density stays the total amount, not per layer. Other patterns use their own sizes.\n\nPattern and motion\nRing height 0 makes a circle; positive height makes a hollow cylinder along Direction. Random/Even and Sphere Inside/Surface control distribution. Line/Ring/Sphere can propagate outward/inward at blocks per tick; Life 0 covers the path. Motion trail fills movement/rotation gaps; Only while moving gates emission. Density applies to each selected type.\n\nParticle picker\nColor, Life and Size are per selection. Effect/Instant effect/Entity effect/Dust and bundled Sable types support RGB; Presets restores appearance while retaining your custom color. Block/item payloads are unsupported. All are cosmetic.\n\nBundled Sable shapes\nSearch sable: electric arc, smoke, energy mote, branching lightning, streak spark, expanding/contracting rings, crescent shard, soft fog and starburst. Life 0 uses native lifetimes; Size 1 is the baseline. Arcs are camera-facing flashes, not lightning joining two marks; their bends change every 2 ticks. Bright particles do not light nearby blocks.\n\nRings face the camera around their own centers, not attack boundaries. Fog grows upward; sparks drift outward without supplied velocity. Fixed starburst stays upright; Starburst chooses and keeps a random angle. Old configurations retain Fixed. Iris uses the standard translucent renderer; without it, soft alpha. Color/lifetime/size/animation work in both.',
    '标记与尺寸\n区域用两个角点；点／线／环／球另用单点标记，初始距离偏移原点。区域／点可加前向长度、对称宽度／高度（0-128），体积随部件旋转。密度保持总量，不按层倍增；其他形状使用自己的尺寸。\n\n形状与运动\n环高度 0 为圆，正数沿方向延伸为空心圆柱。随机／均匀、球内部／表面控制分布。线／环／球可按每 tick 格数向外／向内传播，寿命 0 自动覆盖路径。运动轨迹填补移动／旋转间隙，仅移动时控制是否发射。密度对每种已选粒子分别生效。\n\n粒子选择器\n每项独立设置颜色、寿命与尺寸。效果／瞬间效果／实体效果／尘埃及内置 Sable 粒子支持 RGB；预设恢复外观并保留自定义颜色。暂不支持方块／物品载荷，粒子都不造成伤害。\n\n内置形状\n搜索 sable 可找到电弧、烟雾、能量光点、分支闪电、流光火花、扩张／收缩光环、月牙、柔雾与星芒。寿命 0 用原生时长，尺寸 1 为基准。电弧是面向镜头的闪光，不连接两个标记点；每 2 tick 改变折线。明亮粒子不会照亮方块。\n\n光环围绕自身中心且面向镜头，不表示攻击边界。柔雾上升扩张，无速度的火花向外漂移。固定星芒保持直立，普通星芒随机角度后保持；旧配置保留固定款。Iris 下用标准半透明渲染，否则用柔边渲染；颜色、寿命、尺寸与动画均保留。'),
'wireless_redstone.settings':(
    'Destinations\nMarked faces, external red/blue frequencies and this core\'s internal channel can be combined. Mark-only needs no frequency items; internal/external output needs no mark. New marked output uses the selected surface only.\n\nStrength and timing\nFixed strength uses Power. Hold follows the trigger; Pulse lasts its duration after a rising edge. Reverse swaps zero/strength: reversed Hold is high while idle; reversed Pulse drops for the pulse then returns high, even with a held trigger. Disabled/invalid modules, dormant/dead cores or Master Off output zero.\n\nFollow input preserves 0-15 from Internal wireless, External RX or Anchor power; Always/Move set/Hurt use configured strength. Hold tracks changes; Pulse snapshots the rising-edge strength. Analog Reverse uses 15 minus strength, including 15 outside a pulse.\n\nRamp\nStart to End rises/falls linearly, then holds End while triggered. Ending input immediately outputs zero and resets it. Reverse, Hold/Pulse and pulse duration do not apply; swap endpoints to descend. All destinations share the ramp.\n\nInternal channels and latch\nChoose an enabled Sequence-controlled internal output channel; 0 is unbound. Shared sources combine by highest strength, including ramps. Separate input/output channels to avoid feedback.\n\nFor a lasting phase, enable Latch on a Wireless output channel and send a transition pulse. Reset channel clears it and takes precedence; 0 means none. Input must go low before relatching. Runtime latch state is not saved: trigger it again after reload.',
    '输出目的地\n标记面、红蓝频率外发、核心内部频道可组合使用。只输出标记面无需频率物品；内部／外部输出无需标记。新建标记输出默认只作用于所选面。\n\n强度与时序\n固定强度使用 Power。持续跟随触发，脉冲在上升沿后输出指定时长。反转交换 0 与设定强度：反转持续在空闲时高、触发时低；反转脉冲低电平结束后恢复高，即使触发仍在。禁用／无效模块、休眠／死亡或总开关关均输出 0。\n\n跟随输入保留内部无线、外部接收或标记点电力的 0-15；持续激活／动作抽选／受击触发仍用设定强度。持续实时跟随，脉冲锁定上升沿强度。模拟反转为 15 减输入，脉冲外也输出 15。\n\n渐变\n从起点线性变化到终点，触发期间保持终值；信号结束立即归零并重置。不使用反转、持续／脉冲和脉冲时长；下降渐变交换端点。三个目的地共用渐变。\n\n内部频道与锁存\n选择已启用、序列控制的内部输出频道，0 未绑定；多来源取最高强度，渐变也一样。输入／输出频道分开，避免反馈。\n\n长期阶段效果可在无线输出频道开启锁存，再发送过渡脉冲。重置频道优先清除，0 表示无重置。输入需先变低才能再次锁存；运行锁存状态不保存，重载后需重新触发。'),
'slash.settings':(
    'Blade and aiming\nLength/Width set span/depth; Speed and Range set flight. Count/Fan spread blades symmetrically; Blade rotation tilts the plane. Choose RGB or particles. Interval is between releases, so volleys may overlap in flight (up to 256 blades per module).\n\nStraight uses the mark. Target position samples visible eligible targets at release; one uses core priority, Multiple target sends a full volley to each, up to 64. Search range (default 64, maximum 256) is separate from flight range. No target means no release. Blades do not home or lead targets; angle offsets still apply.\n\nImpact and blocking\nAn optional Persistent area damage template appears on supporting ground for entity hits, or the actual impact face for terrain. Set its shape/duration/damage/burning in that template. Ignite target is separate (default Off, up to 30 seconds), can work on an accepted zero-damage hit and does not apply vanilla fire status to mechanical creatures.\n\nCan be blocked defaults Off. On allows frontal vanilla shields and supported Epic Fight guards/parries; rear hits land. Blocking prevents direct damage, ignition, effects and impact area for that defender, without removing the blade.\n\nLaunch and sound\nStart distance offsets along the original direction; angles/fan change flight, not that offset. Positive horizontal turns right, vertical up. Summoned weapon supplies its own origin/direction. Preview uses cyan positioning and a yellow launch point. Release sound plays once per volley; Flight sound follows each blade until it ends. Duration 0 loops the flight layer; a positive duration limits it. Either mix may be empty.',
    '刀光与瞄准\n长度／宽度决定跨度／厚度，速度和射程决定飞行；数量／扇形角度对称散开，刀光旋转调整平面。可选 RGB 或粒子。间隔按释放计算，因此多批可同时飞行，每模块最多 256 道。\n\n直线沿标记；目标位置在释放时读取可见合法目标。单目标按核心优先级，多目标向每个目标发射完整一批，最多 64 个。搜索范围默认 64、最大 256，与飞行射程独立；无目标不释放，不追踪或预判，角度偏移仍生效。\n\n命中与格挡\n可选持续范围伤害模板：实体命中放到支撑地面，地形命中用实际表面，形状／时长／伤害／燃烧在模板设置。直接点燃独立，默认关、最长 30 秒；接受的零伤害命中也可点燃普通实体，机械生命体不获得原版着火状态。\n\n可格挡默认关。开启后正面可被原版盾牌或支持的 Epic Fight 防御／弹反挡下，背面仍命中。被挡者免受本次直接伤害、点燃、效果和命中区域，不删除整道刀光。\n\n发射与声音\n初始距离沿原方向偏移，角度／扇形只改飞行方向；水平正值向右、竖直正值向上。召唤武装提供自己的原点／方向。预览青线表示定位、黄点表示发射点。释放声每批一次，飞行声跟随每道刀光到结束；时长 0 循环，正数限制该层时长，两个音轨均可留空。'),
'arrow.settings':(
    'Projectile and aim\nChoose appearance, speed, count/scatter and residual time. Visual size, damage, explosion and block breaking are separate. Arrows retain gravity.\n\nStraight uses the mark. Target position samples visible eligible targets at firing; one uses core priority, Multiple target sends a full volley to each (up to 64). Search range defaults 64, maximum 256, independent of flight range. No target means no shot; there is no homing or movement prediction.\n\nLaunch point\nStart distance offsets along the original direction. Angles/fan change flight from that point without rotating the offset; positive horizontal turns right, vertical up. Summoned weapon supplies its own origin/direction. Cyan Preview lines show positioning; yellow marks the muzzle.\n\nImpact\nLanding sound is independent of Fire sound: untouched default uses native arrow audio, a custom mix replaces it, empty is silent. Entity-hit audio is unchanged; explosive block impacts may also play it. Settings survive projectile save/reload.\n\nOptional Persistent area damage uses supporting ground for entity hits or the terrain impact face. Configure its shape/duration/damage/burning in that template; none selected means no extra area.\n\nCustom item visuals\nAlways faces camera suits flat icons such as snowballs. Local X/Y/Z rotation defaults 0, accepts -180 to 180 degrees. Ordinary orientation follows flight; camera-facing offsets follow the viewer instead. These change only the model, not trajectory, gravity, hitbox or Energy cost.',
    '弹射物与瞄准\n选择外观、速度、数量／散布和残留时长。视觉尺寸、伤害、爆炸与破坏方块分开设置；箭矢保留重力。\n\n直线沿标记；目标位置在发射时读取可见合法目标。单目标按核心优先级，多目标向每个目标发射完整一批，最多 64 个。搜索范围默认 64、最大 256，与飞行射程独立；无目标不发射，不追踪或预判。\n\n发射点\n初始距离沿原方向偏移；角度／扇形只改变该点之后的飞行，不旋转位置偏移。水平正值向右，竖直正值向上；召唤武装提供自己的原点／方向。青色预览线表示定位，黄点表示发射点。\n\n命中\n落地声独立于发射声：未修改时用原版箭声，自定义音轨替换，空音轨静音；不改变实体命中声，爆炸落地也可播放。弹射物保存／重载后保留声音设置。\n\n可选持续范围伤害模板，实体命中用支撑地面，地形命中用实际表面；形状／时长／伤害／燃烧在模板设置，未选就没有附加区域。\n\n自定义物品外观\n始终面向镜头适合雪球等平面图标。本地 X/Y/Z 旋转默认 0、范围 -180 到 180 度；普通模式相对飞行方向，面向镜头模式相对观看者。只改模型，不改轨迹、重力、碰撞箱或能量费用。'),
'gun.settings':(
    'Shots and aim\nSpeed, count and Interval control volleys. Visual/collision sizes, explosion damage and terrain breaking are separate.\n\nStraight uses the mark. Target position samples visible eligible targets at firing. One uses core priority; Multiple target sends a full volley to each (up to 64). Search range defaults 64, maximum 256, independent of flight range. No target means no shot. Bullets do not home or lead targets.\n\nLaunch and visuals\nStart distance offsets along the original direction to clear the body; angles/fan change flight without rotating that offset. Positive horizontal turns right, vertical up. Summoned weapon supplies its own origin/direction. Cyan Preview lines show positioning; yellow marks the muzzle.\n\nCustom item X/Y/Z rotation is local to flight, -180 to 180 degrees, default 0. It changes appearance, not aim, trajectory, collision or Energy cost. Mortar models similarly follow their arc; camera-facing arrows use viewer-relative offsets.\n\nImpact area\nSelect a Persistent area damage template for an extra area: supporting ground on entity hits, actual impact face on terrain. Set shape, duration, particles, damage and burning in the template. No template means no extra area.',
    '发射与瞄准\n速度、数量和间隔控制弹幕；视觉／碰撞尺寸、爆炸伤害与地形破坏独立。\n\n直线沿标记；目标位置在发射时读取可见合法目标。单目标按核心优先级，多目标向每个目标发射完整一批，最多 64 个。搜索范围默认 64、最大 256，与飞行射程独立；无目标不发射，不追踪或预判。\n\n发射与外观\n初始距离沿原方向移出身体，角度／扇形不旋转位置偏移；水平正值向右，竖直正值向上。召唤武装提供自己的原点／方向；预览青线表示定位，黄点表示发射点。\n\n自定义物品 X/Y/Z 旋转相对飞行方向，默认 0、范围 -180 到 180 度。只改外观，不改瞄准、轨迹、碰撞或费用；迫击炮模型同样跟随弧线，面向镜头的箭矢则相对观看者旋转。\n\n命中区域\n可选持续范围伤害模板：实体命中放到支撑地面，地形命中用实际表面。形状、时长、粒子、伤害和燃烧在模板设置；未选则没有附加区域。'),
'laser.settings':(
    'Beam and damage\nCharge time precedes firing. Length/Width set collision; Beam hits x Hit interval sets burst timing, while Interval separates bursts. Tracking and horizontal/vertical sweep change aim; sweep 0 fixes that axis.\n\nContinuous beam (default) follows the moving emitter and supports Beam RGB. Legacy particles keeps the older look. Built-in visuals stay enabled even with no extra particles. Visual style does not replace damage width or hit timing.\n\nTerrain cutting\nBreak blocks defaults Off. Clear whole line removes breakable centerline blocks; Cut forward advances from the first obstruction at Breaking speed (default 16 blocks/s), checked every firing tick, independently of hit interval. Allow enough burst time to reach the distance.\n\nOwn connected parts are skipped; unbreakable/protected blocks and unloaded chunks stop cutting. No block-item drops are created, but container removal may release contents. Trigger loss/burst end stops cutting. Charge and Preview do not break terrain.\n\nOrigin and impact\nStart distance offsets along the original direction; angles/sweep turn the beam there, not the offset. Positive horizontal turns right, vertical up. Target modes aim from that point; Summoned weapon supplies its own origin/direction. Preview uses cyan positioning and a yellow origin.\n\nAn optional Persistent area damage template uses supporting ground for entity contacts or the impact face for terrain. Its shape, duration, particles, damage and burning are configured in the template.',
    '光束与伤害\n蓄力后发射，长度／宽度决定碰撞；命中次数×命中间隔决定一轮时序，发射间隔分隔各轮。追踪与水平／竖直扫射改变瞄准，扫射 0 固定对应轴。\n\n默认连续光束跟随移动发射口，支持 RGB；旧粒子保留原外观。额外粒子留空不会关闭内置光束，视觉样式不替代伤害宽度或命中时序。\n\n切割地形\n破坏方块默认关。整线清除移除中心线可破坏方块；向前切割从首个障碍按切割速度推进，默认 16 格／秒，每个发射 tick 检查，与实体命中间隔独立。需留够一轮发射时间才能到达远处。\n\n跳过自身相连部件；不可破坏／受保护方块和未加载区块会阻挡。不产生方块物品，但容器移除可能掉出内容物。信号结束或一轮结束即停切；蓄力和预览不破坏。\n\n原点与命中\n初始距离沿原方向偏移，角度／扫射只从该点转动，不旋转位置偏移；水平正值向右、竖直正值向上。目标模式从此处瞄准，召唤武装提供自己的原点／方向。预览青线表示定位，黄点表示原点。\n\n可选持续范围伤害模板：实体接触用支撑地面，地形接触用命中面；形状、时长、粒子、伤害与燃烧在模板设置。'),
'blueprint_spawn.settings':(
    'File and placement\nServer blueprint selects an approved file from server Sable-Schematics. Singleplayer uses its local game folder; this does not upload a remote client file.\n\nFixed world point stays in the world; Follow marked part uses its pose. Bottom center places the full bounds\' lowest center at the destination; Saved blueprint origin uses its pivot. X/Y/Z offsets use world axes in fixed mode, part-local axes in follow mode.\n\nFollow adds Direction/Start distance for translation. Top/bottom face marks do not automatically pitch the blueprint. Yaw/Pitch/Roll adjust orientation; fixed zero angles preserve the saved pose, explicit angles set its basis. Follow includes the part rotation.\n\nTrigger and limit\nA rising trigger submits one job, subject to cooldown and this module\'s generation limit across the current core activation. Limit 2 means two completed generations total, not two per pulse; Release/reactivation resets it. Delay postpones a submitted job. Activate core needs one ordinary Heart Core and no Redstone Core; Off permits pure structures.\n\nFor death generation, route an Own death Combat Event output to this module\'s trigger. The job freezes the destination at death and waits for cleanup/delay. Release cancels queued work but retains the selected template; Clear removes it. Copies need operator selection again.\n\nPreview\nOnly the requesting player sees cyan bounds and a projection within the server limit. It places nothing and does not validate terrain clearance. A submitted job shows its frozen destination.',
    '文件与位置\n服务器蓝图选择服务端 Sable-Schematics 中批准的文件；单人模式使用本地游戏目录，不会上传远程客户端文件。\n\n固定世界点不随结构移动，跟随标记部件使用其姿态。底面中心把完整边界最低处的中心放到目的地；蓝图原始基准使用保存的枢轴。X/Y/Z 偏移在固定模式用世界轴，跟随模式用部件局部轴。\n\n跟随另有方向／初始距离用于平移，标记顶面／底面不会自动让蓝图俯仰。水平／俯仰／侧倾独立调整：固定模式全 0 保留保存姿态，显式角度设置基准朝向；跟随模式包含部件旋转。\n\n触发与次数\n上升沿提交一次任务，受冷却和本模块在本次生命化内的总次数限制。上限 2 表示合计完成两次，不是每脉冲两次；解除／再激活重置。延迟推迟已提交任务。“激活核心”要求一个普通生命核心且无红石核心，关闭则允许纯结构。\n\n死亡生成需把自身死亡战斗事件的输出接到本模块触发。任务在死亡时固定目的地，等待清理和延迟。解除取消待执行任务但保留蓝图，清除会移除蓝图；复制模块需管理员重新选择。\n\n预览\n只有请求玩家看到青色边界和上限内的投影，不生成实体／方块，也不验证地形空间；任务提交后显示已固定的目的地。'),
'entity_hitbox.troubleshooting':(
    'Damage route\nReceivers are invisible living entities with no AI, pushing, loot or separate health. Loaded cores recreate them; they are not saved. Damage uses core defenses. Solid terrain can block weapons before they reach a box: offset/enlarge it if needed.\n\nHybrid deduplication\nHits settle at tick end. Identified projectiles transfer once per creature across body/receiver routes; a queued receiver hit may be replaced by body contact. Immune body contact still consumes it. Same-attacker melee aliases merge within a tick; different attackers remain separate. Native explosions use the highest part-adjusted contact once per explosion; marked cosmetic spell blasts add no second hit.\n\nPost-damage events report actual core health lost once; incoming/pre-damage hooks run at contact. Continuous body APIs keep their own cadence. Missing/different source IDs or unrelated same-caster attacks may need adapters. Not every weapon, target filter or post-hit effect is supported. Hybrid is experimental; try Entity only for a problematic weapon.\n\nCannot reach the core?\nIn Creative, right-click any active receiver with the Creative Release Tool, including in the off hand. It releases that creature even if the box covers the core. Ordinary interaction does not release it.',
    '伤害入口\n受击框是无 AI、推挤、战利品和独立血量的隐形生命实体，使用核心防御；不保存实体，由已加载核心按需重建。武器可能先撞到地形再碰到框，需要时调整偏移或扩大框。\n\n混合去重\n命中在 tick 末结算。可识别的弹射物在本体／实体两入口间对同生命体只计一次，排队的实体命中可被本体接触替代；免伤的本体接触也消耗该弹。同攻击者的近战别名在同 tick 合并，不同攻击者独立。每次原生爆炸取最高部位修正伤害一次；标记为视觉的法术爆炸不再加伤。\n\n伤后事件按实际扣血只发一次，入站／伤前钩子仍在接触时运行。持续本体接口保留调用方节奏。来源 ID 缺失／不同、同施法者发出无关攻击时可能需适配；不保证所有武器、选敌规则或命中后效果兼容。混合仍属实验，特定武器异常可尝试仅实体。\n\n够不到核心？\n创造模式用创造剪刀右键任一激活受击框即可解除，副手也支持，框覆盖核心也能用；普通交互不会解除。'),
})
for key in ('getting_started.automation',):
    updates[key]=tuple(s.replace('First combination\n1.','First combination\n\n1.').replace('第一个组合\n1.','第一个组合\n\n1.') for s in updates[key])
updates['visual_shockwave.settings']=(
    'Spatial effect\nRing shockwave is the default. Radial blur stretches the world outward from the actual emission point\'s screen position, leaving a clear center; adjust strength, duration and clear-center radius (% of screen height). Released effects stay at their release position. Behind-camera sources draw no ring/blur; HUD stays sharp.\n\nReverse contracts a ring from Radius to center over Expansion time. It does not reverse shake, zoom or distance fading.\n\nCamera\nSpatial effect, Shake and Zoom have separate switches, default On; 0 strength omits a component. Shake works behind the viewer. Frequency (default 1x, 0.1-2x) changes oscillation speed. Positive zoom moves in, negative out; distance fades effects, and the client Distortion Effects setting scales them (0 disables).\n\nRepeat without contact holds zoom while triggered; Interval only spaces waves. Signal end, disabling/removal, Master Off or cleanup releases it. Once/contact/Preview zoom is temporary.\n\nColor filter\nDefault Off; choose preset/RGB, strength and fade times. All players within Effect range receive the same strength. The filter follows the trigger independently of Once/Repeat/contact; exit or signal loss fades out, re-entry blends from its current color. Waves do not restart its fade. Death/Release/Master Off/disable/delete stops it. Filters blend; the client setting scales them too. Preview holds about 3 seconds before fading.',
    '空间效果\n默认环形冲击波。径向模糊从实际发射点的屏幕位置向外拉伸世界，中心保持清晰，可调强度、时长与中心清晰半径（屏幕高度百分比）。已释放效果停留在释放位置；背后来源不显示环／模糊，HUD 保持清晰。\n\n反向让环从半径处在扩张时长内收回中心，不反转震动、缩放或距离衰减。\n\n镜头\n空间效果、震动、缩放独立开关，默认开，强度 0 可省略对应部分。背后也会震动；频率默认 1 倍、范围 0.1-2 倍，控制振动快慢。正缩放拉近、负缩放拉远，距离使效果衰减；客户端扭曲效果设定统一缩放，0 关闭。\n\n非接触的重复模式在触发期间保持缩放，间隔只控制波纹频率；信号结束、禁用／移除、总开关关或清理会释放缩放。单次、接触与预览的缩放为临时效果。\n\n颜色滤镜\n默认关，可设预设／RGB、强度与淡入淡出。效果范围内玩家接受相同强度。滤镜直接跟随触发，独立于单次／重复／接触：离开或信号结束淡出，再进入从当前颜色混合，波纹不重启淡变。死亡、解除、总开关关、禁用／删除会停止。多个滤镜混合，也受客户端设定缩放；预览保持约 3 秒后淡出。')
updates['module_management.settings']=(
    'Add and edit\n+ Add browses All/Signal/Attack/Function/Presets. Search localized names, English names or IDs; select and Add, or double-click. Apply names/numbers with Enter or the checkmark; mode buttons save immediately. Wheel steps depend on the field.\n\nFind and reorder\nSidebar search spans pages and accepts names, types or original numbers; #12 matches module 12 exactly. Clear search to see all. Arrows beside Add reorder modules.\n\nCopy or remove\nCopy inserts an independent module after the original, retaining marks/rules/channels/action references but no runtime. Recheck those bindings before using both. Locked editing or the module limit prevents copying. Disable keeps settings; Delete requires a second click.',
    '添加与编辑\n+ 添加可浏览全部／信号／攻击／功能／预设，支持本地名、英文名和 ID 搜索。选中后添加，或双击直接加入。名称／数值用 Enter 或打钩保存，模式按钮直接保存；滚轮步长随属性变化。\n\n查找与排序\n侧栏搜索跨页匹配名字、类型和原编号，#12 精确找模块 12；清空搜索显示全部。添加旁的箭头可排序。\n\n复制与移除\n复制在原模块后插入独立副本，保留标记／规则／频道／动作引用，不保留运行状态；同时使用前请检查绑定。编辑锁定或达到上限时不能复制。禁用保留设置，删除需第二次点击确认。')

def refine(catalog,languages,changed=None):
    for suffix,pair in updates.items():
        for i,lang in enumerate(('en_us','zh_cn')):
            key='manual.sablelife.'+suffix;languages[lang][key]=pair[i]
            if changed is not None:changed[lang][key]=pair[i]
    catalog['revision']=max(catalog['revision'],178)
    if catalog['revision']>=179:
        import runpy
        runpy.run_path(str(root/'scripts/refine-wireless-guide-179.py'))['refine'](catalog,languages,changed)

if __name__=='__main__':
    catalog=json.loads((base/'manual/catalog.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
    languages={lang:json.loads((base/f'lang/{lang}.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8')) for lang in ('en_us','zh_cn')}
    evidence=root/'diagnostics/manual-reading-178-changes.json'
    before={lang:{'manual.sablelife.'+suffix:strings.get('manual.sablelife.'+suffix,'') for suffix in updates} for lang,strings in languages.items()}
    refine(catalog,languages)
    if not evidence.exists():evidence.write_text(json.dumps({'before':before,'after':{lang:{k:strings[k] for k in before[lang]} for lang,strings in languages.items()}},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
    for lang,strings in languages.items():
        (base/f'lang/{lang}.json').write_text(json.dumps(strings,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
        overlay=root/'scripts'/('english-manual-review.json' if lang=='en_us' else 'chinese-polish.json')
        reviewed=json.loads(overlay.read_text(encoding='utf-8'));reviewed.update({k:strings[k] for k in before[lang]})
        overlay.write_text(json.dumps(reviewed,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
    (base/'manual/catalog.json').write_text(json.dumps(catalog,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
    path=root/'scripts/manual-paragraphs.json';layout=json.loads(path.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
    for suffix,pair in updates.items():
        if suffix in layout:layout[suffix]={lang:text.split('\n\n')[1:] for lang,text in zip(('en_us','zh_cn'),pair)}
    path.write_text(json.dumps(layout,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
    for suffix,pair in updates.items():
        key='manual.sablelife.'+suffix
        print(suffix, len(before['en_us'][key].split()),'->',len(pair[0].split()),'English words')
